1304:instances. Friedman rejects rank equality for every solver
1305:($p<10^{-15}$ throughout). Boldface marks arms not significantly worse
1306:than that solver's top-ranked arm (Holm-corrected paired Wilcoxon,
1307:$\alpha=0.05$).}
1308:\label{tab:ranking}
1309:\begin{tabular}{lccccccc}
1310:\toprule
