1718:The seed pools, the injection operator, the experiment setups, the run
1719:logs of all 51{,}240 runs, the aggregated result tables and the analysis
1720:scripts that produce every table and figure in this paper, together with the
1721:recovered crisp instance matrices of Section~
ef{sec:rpd-ref} and their
1722:hashes, are deposited at
1723:\texttt{[DOI pending]}, together with the independent verifier of
1724:Section~\ref{sec:res-threats} and the commit hash of the solver framework.
